Day 2 : Learning

 Structure of React files

-->Src--App.jsx--main.jsx--index.html
-->App.jsx -- will have the code or any ui you need to create for the project
-->main.jsx -- will have root element from html and render the ui
-->index.html -- which will show the ui what we were doing as only index.html is running in browser

-->Commands to create react app using vite
1.npm create vite
2.Project name: Type your desired name (e.g., my-react-app).
3.Select a framework: Use arrow keys to select React.
4.Select a variant: Choose JavaScript .
5.Go to that folder using cd .
6.Run by using npm run dev(will show localhost running on 5173 port or a link is shown click and view it)

